   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "家装参观：打造热带风情的餐桌布置",
   "texts": [
    "餐桌上摆放着大大的叶子、木板和绿色餐具，餐具里放着水果和酸奶。",
    "<p>用植物和热带水果来打造夏日餐桌，再搭配色彩协调的餐具和天然木材，将夏日阳光带到室内。</p>",
    "家装参观：打造热带风情的餐桌布置",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a8/91/a891cb453d2e1906101adbf3cba0e8b9.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a8/91/a891cb453d2e1906101adbf3cba0e8b9.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "带有叶子形状刺青的手臂握着叶子。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80335706"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/d9/afd9c33d5a9b527b26b9d42f2d3a48c0.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/d9/afd9c33d5a9b527b26b9d42f2d3a48c0.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.打底&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp; 人造龟背竹叶子非常大，可以用作漂亮的餐垫，人造蕨类植物则可以让整体感觉更柔和。只需要用上几片叶子，或者选择一片大大的叶子，营造夸张的效果！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "粉绿色餐具放在木板和叶子上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/7c/22/7c22d9260f2be5e0cddd8b5c62a32d41.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/7c/22/7c22d9260f2be5e0cddd8b5c62a32d41.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.搭配色彩&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp; &nbsp;想要实现有趣又不幼稚的效果，只需选择色彩柔和朴素的餐具，让人们将注意力集中在植物和花朵上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "摆放在叶子上的绿色玻璃水瓶里盛放着水和香草。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40327732"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0d/c8/0dc853b42beb0652f44b5e14c0eb6ff7.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0d/c8/0dc853b42beb0652f44b5e14c0eb6ff7.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.装点润饰</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 在食物上撒一些香草叶，或者将香草放在水里调味，让餐桌的绿意更加盎然。用彩色玻璃器皿营造统一效果。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "木板上摆放着切片的菠萝。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20393488"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/82/46/82468c8a93acee2d322c24592601fa7c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/82/46/82468c8a93acee2d322c24592601fa7c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.加入天然材料</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;木板不仅可以用来切菜。木材温暖的感觉可以为餐桌增添色彩和质感，同时还可以在上面摆放热带水果，充当漂亮的中央装饰品。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Miriam从叶片后面窥视的照片。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/aa/a8/aaa8bea3cbe60aa7b15b82ce1ba84993.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/aa/a8/aaa8bea3cbe60aa7b15b82ce1ba84993.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.展现热情</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 充分利用植物。Miriam说：&ldquo;我喜欢在家里营造户外感觉，所以我选择用植物装饰。我生活在属于自己的小小丛林里，这就是我与大自然接触的方式。&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
